  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "props": {},
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The three petals of band 0 are three pinks: a pale pink, a pink, and a washed pink that I asked for as a variation of the middle one. Each flower of the HDA uses one of the three petals, so one lily has one pink, never three.",
