   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The centre of each tepal and of each bud is green: a gradient that is full on the axis and fades into the pink at the edges. A first version with a flat green rectangle was rejected. Local ambient occlusion, computed from the height, strengthens the pattern in the base colour of band 0, at an intensity of 0.05 set by a parameter called Pattern AO Intensity.",
