  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "props": {},
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "To see the lily without leaving Houdini, the mesh goes to Solaris through a short chain: the mesh import, a node that sets the faces double sided, a material built from the maps, a camera, a dome light with a key and a fill, the Karma render settings and the render node. Four traps took time:",
