     "type": "text",
     "text": "doubleSided",
     "styles": {
      "code": true
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " set to false, so petals and leaves lose their back face. I changed the opacity, the alpha blend mode and even removed the texture before finding it. A small Python node now sets ",
